      "text": [
        " أَكْلُ الرُّمَّانِ الْحُلْوِ يَزِيدُ فِي مَاءِ الرَّجُلِ وَ يُحَسِّنُ الْوَلَدَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Al Husayn Bin Saeed, from Amro Bin Ibrahim, from Al Khurasany who said, ",
          "‘Eating the sweet Pomegranate increases in the water of the man, and improves the childbirths’. (P.s. – This is not a Hadeeth)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "17. It is narrated from the narrator of the previous Hadith from al-Husayn ibn Sa‘id from ‘Amr ibn Ibrahim from al-Khurasaniy who has said the following: “He (the Imam), ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘Eating sweet pomegranate increases one’s seed and forms the child well?” "
        ]
      }
